MODIFICATION NOTICE (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):
This version has been modified from the original. Files carrying changes were
altered from the upstream versions; the git history of this repository records
what changed and when. The principal modifications are:

  - Rebranded to "Tallpine" so it can run side by side with the
    official install: CLI binary "tallpine" (alias "tp"), bundle/app id "ee.justdev.tallpine",
    state root "~/.tallpine", environment prefix "TALLPINE_", default daemon port 3101,
    "tallpine://" link scheme, tmux socket "tallpine", launchd labels
    "ee.justdev.tallpine.*", and "tallpine hooks" agent hook entries.
  - Removed telemetry, analytics and crash reporting.
  - Removed the hosted cloud integration, WorkOS sign-in and the GitHub App.
  - Replaced the upstream auto-updater and release infrastructure with a
    GitHub-Releases updater.
  - Removed the legacy TypeScript-AO import feature.
  - Added a per-install daemon token and a localhost Host allowlist on the
    loopback listener.
  - Limited supported agent harnesses to claude-code, codex and kiro.
  - Added per-project report delivery, automatic worker turn-ended/exited
    notifications, a verifyCommand project setting, soft-verified done reports,
    task intent for the reviewer, .worktreeinclude seeding (with APFS clonefile
    support), a merged-workspace flag, right-click actions on local file paths
    in chat, and several CLI fixes.

